              ( Satellite (span 19 23) (rel2par evaluation-comment)
                ( Nucleus (span 19 20) (rel2par span)
                  ( Satellite (leaf 19) (rel2par organization-preparation) (text _!The inquiries of the Department of Justice and the curious Harvard students have something in common :_!) )
                  ( Nucleus (leaf 20) (rel2par span) (text _!Both are unlikely to turn up any evidence of why some applicants make the cut and others do n’t ._!) )
